l · Stormwind City · 39.8, 29.8; Tiza Battleforge · Ironforge · 27.6, 12.2"},{["name"]="勇气之书",["from"]="勇气之书 · 物品触发",["instructions"]="与暴风城的达索瑞恩·拉尔谈一谈。",["optional"]=false,["nameEn"]="The Tome of Valor",["instructionsEn"]="Speak to Duthorian Rall in Stormwind.",["fromEn"]="Tome of Valor"},{["name"]="勇气之书",["from"]="达索瑞恩·拉尔 · 暴风城 · 39.8, 29.8",["instructions"]="在西部荒野找到达芙妮·斯迪威尔。",["optional"]=false,["nameEn"]="The Tome of Valor",["instructionsEn"]="Find Daphne Stilwell in Westfall.",["fromEn"]="Duthorian Rall · Stormwind City · 39.8, 29.8"},{["name"]="勇气之书",["from"]="达芙妮·斯迪威尔 · 西部荒野 · 41.7, 89.2",["instructions"]="在迪菲亚兄弟会进攻时保护达芙妮·斯迪威尔的安全。 如果你想成功的话，你和达芙妮都不能死在他们的剑下。",["optional"]=false,["nameEn"]="The Tome of Valor",["instructionsEn"]="Defend Daphne Stilwell from the Defias attack. Neither of your spirits must be released from their mortal coils if you wish to succeed. After you are successful, speak to Daphne Stilwell again.",["fromEn"]="Daphne Stilwell · Westfall · 41.7, 89.2"},{["name"]="勇气之书",["from"]="达芙妮·斯迪威尔 · 西部荒野 · 41.7, 89.2",["instructions"]="与暴风城的达索瑞恩·拉尔谈一谈。",["optional"]=false,["nameEn"]="The Tome of Valor",["instructionsEn"]="Speak to Duthorian Rall in Stormwind.",["fromEn"]="Daphne Stilwell · Westfall · 41.7, 89.2"},{["name"]="正义试炼",["from"]="达索瑞恩·拉尔 · 暴风城 · 39.8, 29.8",["instructions"]="去和铁炉堡的乔丹·斯迪威尔谈一谈。",["optional"]=false,["nameEn"]="The Test of Righteousness",["instructionsEn"]="Speak to Jordan Stilwell in Ironforge",["fromEn"]="Duthorian Rall · Stormwind City · 39.8, 29.8"}},["followups"]={{["name"]="正义试炼",["from"]="乔丹·斯迪威尔 · 丹莫罗 · 52.5, 36.9",["instructions"]="等待乔丹·斯迪威尔为你铸造武器。",["optional"]=false,["nameEn"]="The Test of Righteousness",["instructionsEn"]="Wait for Jordan Stilwell to finish forging a weapon for you.",["fromEn"]="Jordan Stilwell · Dun Morogh · 52.5, 36.9"}},["rewards"]={},["rewardNote"]="仅限圣骑士——需收集白石橡木（死亡矿井）、乔丹的铁锤（影牙城堡）和科尔宝石（黑暗深渊）",["rewardNoteEn"]="Paladin only — gathers Whitestone Oak Lumber (Deadmines), Jordan's Smithing Hammer (Sha