cked up","Neck","+11 Stamina","+10 Strength","+5 Spirit","+4 Agility","Sell Price: 1g 23s 77c"},["referenceLinesEn"]={"Binds when picked up","Neck","+11 Stamina","+10 Strength","+5 Spirit","+4 Agility","Sell Price: 1g 23s 77c"},["basis"]="classic",["mapping"]="classic-reference",["uncertain"]=true,["bosses"]={},["sourceDate"]="2026-10-01",["rewardMode"]="given"}},["steps"]={},["followups"]={},["prerequisites"]="",["basis"]="classic",["races"]=178,["classes"]=0,["minLevel"]=52,["repeatable"]=false,["pre"]={4121},["inside"]=false,["faction"]="horde",["factionSource"]="archive-explicit",["nameTw"]="行動：殺死安格弗將軍",["sources"]={"https://foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/blackrock-depths"},["sourceDate"]="2026-10-01",["conditionsSource"]="EverythingQuests Forever"},{["id"]=4121,["name"]="押送囚徒",["nameEn"]="Precarious Predicament",["instructions"]="押送你的囚犯格拉克·洛克鲁布。穿过燃烧平原和黑石山脉，一直走到灼热峡谷。\n\n雷克斯洛特曾经告诉过你，他会让他的人等在黑石山脉的另外一边准备接收格拉克。\n\n另外，你还要把瑟银镣铐一并还给雷克斯洛特。",["instructionsEn"]="Escort your prisoner, Grark Lorkrub, through Burning Steppes and through Blackrock Mountain to the Searing Gorge.  You recall Lexlort mentioning that he would have his men waiting on the other side to take Grark into custody.  You will also be required to hand over your Thorium Shackles to Lexlort.",["from"]="Grark Lorkrub · Burning Steppes",["fromEn"]="Grark Lorkrub · Burning Steppes",["gatesKnown"]=true,["itemStart"]=false,["rewards"]={},["steps"]={{["name"]="Grark Lorkrub",["nameEn"]="Grark Lorkrub",["from"]="Lexlort · Badlands",["instructions"]=""}},["followups"]={},["prerequisites"]="Grark Lorkrub",["basis"]="classic",["races"]=178,["classes"]=0,["minLevel"]=52,["repeatable"]=false,["pre"]={4122},["inside"]=false,["faction"]="horde",["factionSource"]="archive-explicit",["nameTw"]="押送囚徒",["prerequisitesEn"]="Grark Lorkrub",["sources"]={"https://foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/blackrock-depths"},["sourceDate"]="2026-10-01",["conditionsSource"]="EverythingQuests Forever"},{["id"]=4063,["name"]="机器的崛起",["nameEn"]="The Rise of the Machines",["instructions"]="找到并杀掉傀儡统帅阿格曼奇，将他的头交给鲁特维尔。你还需要从守卫着阿格曼奇的狂怒傀儡和战斗傀儡身上收集10块完整的元素核心。",["instructionsEn"]="Find and slay Golem Lord Argelmach. Return his head to Lotwil. You will also need to collect 10 Intact Elemental Cores from the Ragereaver Golems and Warbringer Constructs protecting Argelmach. You know this because you are psychic.",["from"]="Lotwil Veriatus · Badlands",["fromEn"]="Lotwil Veriatus · Badlands",["gatesKnown"]=true,["itemStart"]=false,["rewards"]={{["id"]=12109,["name"]="Azure Moon Amice",["nameEn"]="Azure Moon Amice",["quality"]=2,["level"]=0,["ilvl"]=58,["slot"]=nil,["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\inv_shoulder_02",["stats"]={},["effects"]={},["effectsEn"]={},["referenceLines"]={"Binds when picked up","Shoulder\tCloth","56 Armor","+8 Stamina","+15 Intellect","Sell Price: 1g 15s 69c"},["referenceLinesEn"]={"Binds when picked up","Shoulder\tCloth","56 Armor","+8 Stamina","+15 Intellect","Sell Price: 1g 15s 69c"},["basis"]="classic",["mapping"]="classic-reference",["uncertain"]=true,["bosses"]={},["sourceDate"]="2026-10-01",["rewardMode"]="choice"},{["id"]=12110,["name"]="Raincaster Drape",["nameEn"]="Raincaster Drape",["quality"]=2,["level"]=0,["ilvl"]=58,["slot"]=nil,["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\inv_misc_cape_16",["stats"]={},["effects"]={},["effectsEn"]={},["referenceLines"]={"Binds when picked up","Back\tCloth","38 Armor","+9 Spirit","Equip: Increases healing done by spells and effects by up to 22.","Sell Price: 1g 16s 10c"},["referenceLinesEn"]={"Binds when picked up","Back\tCloth","38 Armor","+9 Spirit","Equip: Increases healing done by spells and effects by up to 22.","Sell Price: 1g 16s 10c"},["basis"]="classic",["mapping"]="classic-reference",["uncertain"]=true,["bosses"]={},["sourceDate"]="2026-10-01",["rewardMode"]="choice"},{["id"]=12108,["name"]="Basaltscale Armor",["nameEn"]="Basaltscale Armor",["quality"]=2,["level"]=0,["ilvl"]=58,["slot"]=nil,["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\inv_chest_chain_16",["stats"]={},["effects"]={},["ef