en and slay her. Return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain with the recombined Lord Valthalak's Amulet and the Brazier of Beckoning.",["from"]="Bodley · Burning Steppes",["fromEn"]="Bodley · Burning Steppes",["gatesKnown"]=false,["itemStart"]=false,["rewards"]={},["steps"]={{["name"]="More Components of Importance",["nameEn"]="More Components of Importance",["from"]="Bodley · Burning Steppes",["instructions"]=""}},["followups"]={},["prerequisites"]="More Components of Importance",["basis"]="classic",["faction"]="both",["factionSource"]="archive-explicit",["minLevel"]=58,["nameTw"]="瓦薩拉克領主護符的右半塊",["prerequisitesEn"]="More Components of Importance",["sources"]={"https://foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/dire-maul-east","https://foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/dire-maul-north","https://foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/dire-maul-west"},["sourceDate"]="2026-10-01",["conditionsSource"]="Community minimum only; other conditions unverified"},{["id"]=7463,["name"]="久违的法师",["nameEn"]="Arcane Refreshment",["instructions"]="到厄运之槌的扭木广场去杀掉水元素海多斯博恩。把海多斯博恩精华交给图书馆的博学者莱德罗斯。",["instructionsEn"]="Travel to the Warpwood Quarter of Dire Maul and slay the water elemental, Hydrospawn. Return to Lorekeeper Lydros in the Athenaeum with the Hydrospawn Essence.",["from"]="Lorekeeper Lydros",["fromEn"]="Lorekeeper Lydros",["gatesKnown"]=false,["itemStart"]=false,["rewards"]={},["steps"]={},["followups"]={},["prerequisites"]="",["basis"]="classic",["faction"]="both",["factionSource"]="archive-explicit",["minLevel"]=60,["nameTw"]="久違的法師",["sources"]={"https://foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/dire-maul-east"},["sourceDate"]="2026-10-01",["conditionsSource"]="Community minimum only; other conditions unverified"},{["id"]=7507,["name"]="诺斯特罗的屠龙技术纲要",["nameEn"]="Foror's Compendium",["instructions"]="将《诺斯特罗的屠龙技术纲要》还回图书馆。",["instructionsEn"]="Return Foror's Compendium of Dragon Slaying to the Athenaeum.",["from"]="Foror's Compendium of Dragon Slaying",["fromEn"]="Foror's Compendium of Dragon Slaying",["gatesKnown"]=false,["itemStart"]=true,["rewards"]={},["steps"]={},["followups"]={},["prerequisites"]="",["basis"]="classic",["faction"]="both",["factionSource"]="archive-explicit",["minLevel"]=60,["nameTw"]="弗洛爾的屠龍技術綱要",["sources"]={"https://foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/dire-maul-east","https://foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/dire-maul-north","https://foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/dire-maul-west"},["sourceDate"]="2026-10-01",["conditionsSource"]="Community minimum only; other conditions unverified"},{["id"]=7508,["name"]="铸造奎尔塞拉",["nameEn"]="The Forging of Quel'Serrar",["instructions"]="把黯淡的精灵剑交给博学者莱德罗斯。",["instructionsEn"]="Give the Dull and Flat Elven Blade to Lorekeeper Lydros.",["from"]="A Dull and Flat Elven Blade",["fromEn"]="A Dull and Flat Elven Blade",["gatesKnown"]=false,["itemStart"]=true,["rewards"]={},["steps"]={},["followups"]={{["name"]="The Forging of Quel'Serrar",["nameEn"]="The Forging of Quel'Serrar",["faction"]="both",["instructions"]="You must get Onyxia to breathe fire on the Unfired Ancient Blade. Once this is done, pick up the now Heated Ancient Blade. Be warned, a Heated Ancient Blade will not remain heated forever - time is of the essence.  The last step before returning to me is to slay the beast and drive the Heated Ancient Blade into her corpse.  Do this and Quel'Serrar will be yours.",["instructionsEn"]="You must get Onyxia to breathe fire on the Unfired Ancient Blade. Once this is done, pick up the now Heated Ancient Blade. Be warned, a Heated Ancient Blade will not remain heated forever - time is of the essence.  The last step before returning to me is to slay the beast and drive the Heated Ancient Blade into her corpse.  Do this and Quel'Serrar will be yours."}},["prerequisites"]="",["basis"]="classic",["faction"]="both",["factionSource"]="archive-explicit",["minLevel"]=60,["nameTw"]="鑄造奎爾塞拉",["sources"]={"https://foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/dire-maul-east","https://foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/dire-maul-north","https://foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/dire-maul-west"},["sourceDate"]="2026-10-01",["conditionsSource"]="Community minimum only; other conditions unverified"},{["id"]=5518,["name"]="戈多克食人魔装",["nameEn"]="The Gordok Ogre Suit",["instructions"]="把4份符文布卷、8块硬甲皮、2卷符文线和一份食人魔鞣酸交给诺特·希姆加克。他现在被拴在厄运之槌的戈多克食人魔那边。",["instructionsEn"]="Bring 4 Bolts of Runecloth, 8 Rugged Leather, 2 Rune Threads, and Ogre Tannin to Knot Thimblejack.  He is currently chained inside the Gordok wing of Dire Maul.",["from"]="Knot Thimblejack",["fromEn"]="Knot Thimblejack",["gatesKnown"]=false,["itemStart"]=false,["rewards"]={{["id"]=18258,["name"]="戈多克食人魔装",["nameEn"]="Gordok Ogre Suit",["quality"]=2,["level"]=0,["ilvl"]=55,["slot"]=nil,["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\inv_chest_chain_14",["stats"]={},["effects"]={},["effectsEn"]={},["referenceLines"]={"唯一","\t任务","需要等级 55","使用： 将你伪装成一个戈多克食人魔，甚至有可能骗过某个食人魔的军官！这套衣服只能穿10分钟。","\"兼备扩大和支撑体型的功效！\""},["referenceLinesEn"]={"Unique","\tQuest","Requires Level 55","Use: Disguise yourself as one of the Gordok ogres, and maybe even fool a particular captain in the process! The suit will only hold together for 10 min.","\"It lifts AND supports!\""},["basis"]="classic",["mapping"]="classic-reference",["uncertain"]=true,["bosses"]={},["sourceDate"]="2026-10-01",["rewardMode"]="given"}},["steps"]={},["followups"]={},["prerequisites"]="",["basis"]="classic",["faction"]="both",["factionSource"]="archive-explicit",["minLevel"]=56,["nameTw"]="戈多克食人魔裝",["sources"]={"https://foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/dire-maul-north"},["sourceDate"]="2026-10-01",["conditionsSource"]="Community minimum only; other conditions unverified"},{["id"]=5525,["name"]="逃出生天！",["nameEn"]="Free Knot!",["instructions"]="收集 戈多克镣铐钥匙 ×1",["instructionsEn"]="",["from"]="Knot Thimblejack",["fromEn"]="Knot Thimblejack",["gatesKnown"]=false,["itemStart"]=false,["rewards"]={},["steps"]={},["followups"]={},["prerequisites"]="",["basis"]="classic",["faction"]="both",["factionSource"]="archive-explicit",["minLevel"]=57,["nameTw"]="逃出生天！",["sources"]={"https://foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/dire-maul-north"},["sourceDate"]="2026-10-01",["conditionsSource"]="Community minimum only; other conditions unverified"},{["id"]=7461,["name"]="伊莫塔尔的疯狂",["nameEn"]="The Madness Within",["instructions"]="你必须干掉5座水晶塔周围的守卫，那5座水晶塔维持着关押伊莫塔尔的监狱。一旦水晶塔的能量被削弱，伊莫塔尔周围的能量力场就会消散。\n\n进入伊莫塔尔的监狱，干掉站在中间的那个恶魔。最后，在图书馆挑战托塞德林王子。\n\n当任务完成之后，到庭院中去找辛德拉古灵。",["instructionsEn"]="You must destroy the guardians surrounding the 5 Pylons that power the Prison of Immol'thar. Once the Pylons have powered down, the force field surrounding Immol'thar will have dissipated.  Enter the Prison of Immol'thar and eradicate the foul demon that stands at its heart. Finally, confront Prince Tortheldrin in Athenaeum.  Return to the Shen'dralar Ancient in the courtyard should you complete this quest.",["from"]="Shen'dralar Ancient",["fromEn"]="Shen'dralar Ancient",["gatesKnown"]=false,["itemStart"]=false,["rewards"]={},["steps"]={},["followups"]={},["prerequisites"]="",["basis"]="classic",["faction"]="both",["factionSource"]="archive-explicit",["minLevel"]=56,["nameTw"]="伊莫塔爾的瘋狂",["sources"]={"https://foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/dire-maul-west"},["sourceDate"]="2026-10-01",["conditionsSource"]="Community minimum only; other conditions unverified"}},["bosses"]={{["key"]="Pusillin",["name"]="普希林",["nameEn"]="Pusillin",["aliases"]={"Pusillin","普希林"},["kind"]="boss"},{["key"]="Zevrim Thornhoof",["name"]="瑟雷姆·刺蹄",["nameEn"]="Zevrim Thornhoof",["aliases"]={"Zevrim Thornhoof","瑟雷姆·刺蹄"},["kind"]="boss"},{["key"]="Hydrospawn",["name"]="海多斯博恩",["nameEn"]="Hydrospawn",["aliases"]={"Hydrospawn","海多斯博恩"},["kind"]="boss"},{["key"]="Lethtendris",["name"]="蕾瑟塔蒂丝",["nameEn"]="Lethtendris",["aliases"]={"Lethtendris","蕾瑟塔蒂丝"},["kind"]="boss"},{["key"]="Alzzin the Wildshaper",["name"]="奥兹恩",["nameEn"]="Alzzin the Wildshaper",["aliases"]={"Alzzin the Wildshaper","奥兹恩"},["kind"]="boss"},{["key"]="Guard Mol'dar",["name"]="卫兵摩尔达",["nameEn"]="Guard Mol'dar",["aliases"]={"Guard Mol'dar","卫兵摩尔达"},["kind"]="boss"},{["k