,"Sell Price: 81s 44c"},["referenceLinesEn"]={"Binds when picked up","Trinket","Use: Increases Stamina by 10 and reduces physical damage taken by 5 for 10 min. However, lowers Strength and Agility by 5 and increases magical damage taken by up to 20. (30 Min Cooldown)","Sell Price: 81s 44c"},["basis"]="classic",["mapping"]="classic-reference",["uncertain"]=true,["bosses"]={},["sourceDate"]="2026-10-01",["rewardMode"]="given"}},["steps"]={},["followups"]={},["prerequisites"]="",["basis"]="classic",["races"]=0,["classes"]=0,["minLevel"]=55,["repeatable"]=false,["inside"]=false,["faction"]="both",["factionSource"]="archive-explicit",["nameTw"]="蛛後的乳汁",["sources"]={"https://foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/lower-blackrock-spire","https://foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/upper-blackrock-spire"},["sourceDate"]="2026-10-01",["conditionsSource"]="EverythingQuests Forever"},{["id"]=6569,["name"]="黑龙幻象",["nameEn"]="Oculus Illusions",["instructions"]="到黑石塔去收集20颗黑色龙人的眼球，完成任务之后回到巫女麦兰达那里。",["instructionsEn"]="Travel to Blackrock Spire and collect 20 Black Dragonspawn Eyes. Return to Myranda the Hag when the task is complete.",["from"]="Myranda the Hag · Western Plaguelands",["fromEn"]="Myranda the Hag · Western Plaguelands",["gatesKnown"]=true,["itemStart"]=false,["rewards"]={},["steps"]={{["name"]="The Testament of Rexxar",["nameEn"]="The Testament of Rexxar",["from"]="Rexxar · Feralas",["instructions"]=""}},["followups"]={},["prerequisites"]="The Testament of Rexxar",["basis"]="classic",["races"]=178,["classes"]=0,["minLevel"]=55,["repeatable"]=false,["pre"]={6568},["chain"]=6570,["inside"]=false,["faction"]="horde",["factionSource"]="archive-explicit",["nameTw"]="黑龍幻象",["prerequisitesEn"]="The Testament of Rexxar",["sources"]={"https://foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/lower-blackrock-spire"},["sourceDate"]="2026-10-01",["conditionsSource"]="EverythingQuests Forever"},{["id"]=5127,["name"]="恶魔熔炉",["nameEn"]="The Demon Forge",["instructions"]="到黑石塔去找到古拉鲁克。杀死他，然后用血污长矛刺入他的尸体。当他的灵魂被吸干后，这支矛就会成为穿魂长矛。\n\n你还必须找到未铸造的符文覆饰胸甲。\n\n将穿魂长矛和未铸造的符文覆饰胸甲都交给冬泉谷的罗拉克斯。",["instructionsEn"]="Travel to Blackrock Spire and find Goraluk Anvilcrack. Slay him and then use the Blood Stained Pike upon his corpse. After his soul has been siphoned, the pike will be Soul Stained.  You must also find the Unforged Rune Covered Breastplate.  Return both the Soul Stained Pike and the Unforged Rune Covered Breastplate to Lorax in Winterspring.",["from"]="Lorax · Winterspring",["fromEn"]="Lorax · Winterspring",["gatesKnown"]=true,["itemStart"]=false,["rewards"]={{["id"]=12696,["name"]="设计图：魔铸胸甲",["nameEn"]="Plans: Demon Forged Breastplate",["quality"]=3,["level"]=0,["ilvl"]=57,["slot"]=nil,["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\inv_scroll_03",["stats"]={},["effects"]={},["effectsEn"]={},["referenceLines"]={"拾取后绑定","\t锻造","需要锻造（260）","\"教你学会制作魔铸胸甲。\"","卖价：50银"},["referenceLinesEn"]={"Binds when picked up","\tBlacksmithing","Requires Blacksmithing (260)","\"Teaches you how to make a Demon Forged Breastplate.\"","Sell Price: 50s"},["basis"]="classic",["mapping"]="classic-reference",["uncertain"]=true,["bosses"]={},["sourceDate"]="2026-10-01",["rewardMode"]="given"},{["id"]=9224,["name"]="Potion of Demon Slaying",["nameEn"]="Potion of Demon Slaying",["quality"]=1,["level"]=0,["ilvl"]=50,["slot"]=nil,["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\inv_potion_27",["stats"]={},["effects"]={},["effectsEn"]={},["referenceLines"]={"\tElixirs","Requires Level 40","Use: Increases Attack Power by 180 against Demons. Lasts 5 min.","Sell Price: 7s"},["referenceLinesEn"]={"\tElixirs","Requires Level 40","Use: Increases Attack Power by 180 against Demons. Lasts 5 min.","Sell Price: 7s"},["basis"]="classic",["mapping"]="classic-reference",["uncertain"]=true,["bosses"]={},["sourceDate"]="2026-10-01",["rewardMode"]="given"},{["id"]=12849,["name"]="Demon Kissed Sack",["nameEn"]="Demon Kissed Sack",["quality"]=2,["level"]=0,["ilvl"]=61,["slot"]=nil,["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\inv_misc_bag_13",["stats"]={},["effects"]={},["effectsEn"]={},["referen